# Casual Maze Game — Git Attributes Configuration
# Enforces LF line endings across all platforms (Windows, Linux, macOS)
# to prevent cryptographic hash drift and CI check failures.

* text=auto eol=lf
*.svg text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
